Check positive non-NULL component witnesses and all membership predicates
there as ordinary assertions; no child destruction, detach, reparent,
capture, API or other actor check is newly excused. The original Windows
tables and server hunks are unchanged. The returned JSON contains first
messages per line, not all contexts; later failures' attribution remains
a hypothesis to be checked by the last paired round. Native v5 L1 passed Windows 10 x86_64/i386: 16719 checks each, zero
failures/skips and both complete observation scopes. Focused paired L2
42772336963 is green: zero ordinary series failures, full component
coverage, 16 todos and one explicitly unavailable absolute-state scope.
